":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"173"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"},"weight":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"62"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"An invader from another world. He is born from a human mother and a demon. Because he was born with the human appearance, he was almost killed off. But thanks to his magical powers inherited from his mother, he was raised as a magician instead. However, he continued to be persecuted by the demons, and his mother also went insane from stress and committed suicide. Still, he became a skilled magician and was entrusted with a unit of demons. Yet, his hatred for the demonkind has not yet to be sated."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c125380"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"異世界からの侵略者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人間の女性と魔族の間に生まれる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"母親側の人間の外見を持って生まれてきてしまったため始末されそうになるが、母親譲りの魔力があり魔術師として育てられる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし魔族の間で迫害を受け続け、母親は心労の末発狂して自殺。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"魔術師として脳では確かで、魔族の一部隊を任せられるようになる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、魔族への憎悪を胸に秘めたまま消えてはいない。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"27564","sourceWorkId":"34013","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"異世界からの侵略者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人間の女性と魔族の間に生まれる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"母親側の人間の外見を持って生まれてきてしまったため始末されそうになるが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"母親譲りの魔力があり魔術師として育てられる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし魔族の間で迫害を受け続け、母親は心労の末発狂して自殺。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ラディトールは魔族の支配者となり、復讐することを誓う。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"129070"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/dc/dc79d0f9ce9e2c5f541af2d74c8363f0ac1a4c18a4d1d83da5a7995225b7a7f9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4b/4b6f1bb