"spoiler":false,"text":"異世界ムンコスミオスからやってきた光装具の管理者を助けたことがきっかけで、アークブレイバーの力を得る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"光装具アレクサンドロスの力で変身し、アークエリモスへとその身を変える。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"世界の管理者を僭称する存在との最後の戦いの影響で、現在は変身することができなくなっている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24860","sourceWorkId":"36830","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"85 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24860","sourceWorkId":"34013","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"85 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24860","sourceWorkId":"34013","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"60 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24860","sourceWorkId":"34013","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1a/1a970ed7da575177b9c85fafc42e222eeb0d6f11bcd2b2a8fff338c79097a5da.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1b/1b32367b58ecc09c04ca63981de2d5a2e45f63f14fb06a6b2a6941f1d93b35b3.webp","width":205,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c135675","characterName":"アークフェルメント","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[],"egsCharacterIds":["24861"],"vndbCharacterId":"c135675"},"originalCharacterName":"アークフェルメント","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"90"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"89"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"62"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Yunoka's form when she is transformed by the power of the light armor, Musashi. Unlike her shy self prior the transformation, she fights aggressively as Arch Ferment to defeat evildoers. She wields two unsigned katanas, a long sword, Kin (Gold), and a wakizashi, Gin (Silver). With unparallel speed, she roams the battlefield slashing down enemies left and right. Her finishing move is Kobokumei (Leafless Tree's Cry), slash attacks of divine speed."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c135675"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"光装具ムサシによって結乃華が変身した姿。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"引っ込み思案な結乃華と違い、変身したアークフェルメントは悪を倒すために積極的に戦いを展開する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"二刀を武器としており、長刀が無銘・金、脇差が無銘・銀。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのスピードと絶え間なく振るわれる斬撃で、戦場を縦横無尽に駆け回る遊撃戦士。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"必殺技は神速で切り刻む枯木鳴。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24861","sourceWorkId":"34013","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"アークブレイバーの一人、アークフェルメント。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"澄のクラスメートで親友。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"澄とは対照的に引っ込み思案で気弱。明るく朗らかな澄に憧れている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"成績優秀で、よく澄に勉強を教えている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"義父に性的虐待を受けるが、澄や教師たちの協力によって無事救い出される。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"現在は学生寮に住む澄のルームメイトとして共同生活を送っている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24861","sourceWorkId":"34681","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"澄のクラスメートで親友。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"澄とは対照的に引っ込み思案で気弱。明るく朗らかな澄に憧れている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"成績優秀で、よく澄に勉強を教えている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"両親が離婚後、義父から性的虐待を受けるが、澄によって救われる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"光装具ムサシの力で二刀流の剣士へと変身する。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24861","sourceWorkId":"36830","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"90 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24861","sourceWorkId":"34013","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"89 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24861","sourceWorkId":"34013","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"62 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24861","sourceWorkId":"34013","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/35/35c2a4a1fc8fb44daff6a8328c36be454075f6be365876b5cc543ac91594a4ec.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0b/0bf6d4518535721707e72ec111e33cfaf43a89022e5a7e544553b8b11c7059ec.webp","width":205,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c125377","characterName":"清木 澄","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c125377"},"originalCharacterName":"清木 澄","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"83"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"83"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"60"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"One of the heroines. Sumi is a student at Migouji Academy. When she was little, her parents lost their lives to a heinous criminal. Without any relatives to depend on, Sumi had to live by herself. Still, she received help from kind-hearted adults around her so that she could live alone. When her father was alive, he taught her that if you could help someone, someone will surely help you. Growing up with the teaching in her mind, Sumi strived to become a person that can help others. She is innocent and has little knowledge about sex."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c125377"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/79/790e728506800e3ab7a4857f241250c105df86ee5f1622d04b6d048db3ae85c7.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/69/69140baea22f383b19ff38aa6ad80f84808bf49bbea14c8a5c8d1cca71ebef4a.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"結城 ほのか","creatorId":"vndb:s6018","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s6018","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s6018","name":"結城 ほのか","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:94575","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c125378","characterName":"小野上 結乃華","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c125378"},"originalCharacterName":"小野上 結乃華","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"82"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"83"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"59"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A classmate and best friend of Sumi. In contrast to Sumi, Yunoka is shy and timid. She admires the bright and cheerful Sumi. Due to her excellent grades, Yunoka often teaches Sumi how to study. Her parents divorced when she was young. Later, her mother remarried, but she could not stand her second husband and left alone, leaving Yunoka with her stepfather. Living together alone, Yunoka's stepfather begins to succumb to his desire."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c125378"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/da/da757cfc4a683eb487432972412706db94591cee5bd61bc6b9252b521cb0dc6b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/09/0996cfac93cd5f18d9cd37b9bb73606ee50d5827a5fecb38ff6eeabef2c4a4de.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"ひもり ちさ","creatorId":"vndb:s8150","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s8150","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s8150","name":"ひもり ちさ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:94576","source":"vndb"}]},{"characte